Interchange StaffAssociation [2523]
    documentation 'This interchange defines staff and teacher information. It can be used to define 
                  'employment, assignment, and teaching associations, as well as staff positions 
                  'and staff leave events.
    element Staff [2523-001]
    element StaffEducationOrganizationEmploymentAssociation [2523-002]
    element StaffEducationOrganizationAssignmentAssociation [2523-003]
    element StaffSchoolAssociation [2523-004]
    element StaffSectionAssociation [2523-005]
    element LeaveEvent [2523-006]
    element OpenStaffPosition [2523-007]
    element StaffProgramAssociation [2523-008]